          "content_text": "包含： Corn Starch 丶Magnesium Stearate 丶 新歷芳廠之硬膠囊來源(Cap: Gelatin; Titanium Dioxide; Sunset Yellow FCF; Sodium Lauryl Sulfate; New Coccin; Purified Water. Body: Gelatin; Titanium Dioxide; Sodium Lauryl Sulfate; Tartrazine; Purified Water) 。 大豐廠之硬膠囊來源(Cap: Gelatin; Titanium Dioxide; Sunset Yellow FCF; Sodium Lauryl Sulfate; New Coccin; Purified Water;Glycerol. Body: Gelatin; Titanium Dioxide; Sodium Lauryl Sulfate; Tartrazine; Purified Water;Glycerol) 。",
          "content_html": "<p>包含： Corn Starch 丶Magnesium Stearate 丶</p><p>新歷芳廠之硬膠囊來源(Cap: Gelatin; Titanium Dioxide; Sunset Yellow FCF; Sodium Lauryl Sulfate; New Coccin; Purified Water. Body: Gelatin; Titanium Dioxide; Sodium Lauryl Sulfate; Tartrazine; Purified Water) 。</p><p>大豐廠之硬膠囊來源(Cap: Gelatin; Titanium Dioxide; Sunset Yellow FCF; Sodium Lauryl Sulfate; New Coccin; Purified Water;Glycerol. Body: Gelatin; Titanium Dioxide; Sodium Lauryl Sulfate; Tartrazine; Purified Water;Glycerol)&nbsp;。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
